{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43004","headline":"孤雁 · 张子明","name":"孤雁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"只影翩翩下碧湘，傍池鸳鹭宿银塘。\n虽逢夜雨迷深浦，终向晴天着旧行。\n忆伴几回思片月，蜕翎多爲系繁霜。\n江南塞北俱关念，两地飞归是故乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张子明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43004.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43004","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}